Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:22.88,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'm told the assassins\Ngave us useful information.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.02,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The rebels were trying to kidnap \Nyou as a bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:29.83,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:33.50,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It sounds like they gave in rather easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.33,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It's possible they're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:38.59,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You are clever, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:41.32,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,But not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.32,0:00:44.80,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,There is a way to find out if \None is speaking the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.91,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,It takes a thief to catch a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:49.98,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I'm not knowledgeable\Nin the ways of torture,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:52.46,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,so I'll just take his word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:55.09,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Well done, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:00:57.13,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Had you been captured,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:01:01.12,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,the empire would have been forced \Nto make a difficult choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:01.88,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:06.53,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Also, setting your sights on \Ntheir horses was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:13.03,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I only just now gave the order \Nto buy up all the horse feed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.03,0:01:16.77,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,This has happened before, \Nbut not this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:21.47,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Anyone could have had the idea \Nto use starvation tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:26.32,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,In fact, Albert had just \Nsuggested starving the rebels
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:27.73,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(272,433)\pos(601.333,262.667)}Albert Ararat\N{\fs13}Crown Prince, Second Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:28.74,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,to make examples of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.74,0:01:33.74,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,But you realized that it could \Ncause them to attack our people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:36.49,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,and chose to starve only their horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:38.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,With your own funds, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:41.00,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Your ideas...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:43.44,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,and ability to act on them...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:46.18,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,are most impressive, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.18,0:01:48.11,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,That is not an easy thing to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:54.59,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Thank you, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:58.86,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I must reward you somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:06.06,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I permit the addition of \Na sword to Noah's crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:10.52,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The empire is a nation of warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.35,0:02:13.50,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Adding a sword, the symbol of a warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:17.27,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,to one's crest without the emperor's \Npermission is sacrilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.27,0:02:19.56,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,It may even be punished by death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:26.29,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,On the other hand, being granted the \Nemperor's permission to add one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:28.50,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,is among the greatest \Nhonors one can earn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.54,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Cruz, issue the proclamation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:33.22,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,At once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:35.79,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.58,0:02:54.56,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\c&H4F7C81&\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs10\pos(320,142.5)}Born Blessed, So I'll Obtain Ultimate Power
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:54.56,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\p1\bord2\c&H291505&\alpha&H255&\3c&H2986A5&\fscx87\pos(311,141.167)}m 0 0 l 235 0 l 225 8 l 235 15 l 18 15 l 30 8 l 18 0
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:25.68,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,I have been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:26.83,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You're early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:31.37,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,There are only so many types of \Nfeed designed to be transported,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:33.81,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,and we know the route \Nused to bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:37.38,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,It won't be difficult \Nto buy up all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:42.07,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Also, regarding Karfun, the \Nleader of the rebels...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:47.85,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,He is extremely tenacious and will do \Nwhatever it takes to achieve his goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:51.29,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,I'm certain it's nothing \Nyou need to worry about,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:52.99,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,but please, do be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:54.58,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Why tell me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.64,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,M-Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.98,0:05:00.52,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,I apologize for interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:03.14,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,There's a wounded man at the main gate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:05.77,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,who says he has an urgent report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:13.36,Default,Captain1,0,0,0,,It's an honor to meet you, \NYour Imperial Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:19.54,Default,Captain1,0,0,0,,I serve as a decurion in the \Nprovince of Adora in Almeria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:20.73,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:24.11,Default,Captain1,0,0,0,,A rebellion has begun in Almeria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:26.65,Default,Captain1,0,0,0,,My superior started an uprising...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.65,0:05:31.51,Default,Captain1,0,0,0,,but I couldn't go along with it, \Nso I fled to report to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:36.73,sign_generic,EpTitle,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(527,722)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 205)}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:36.73,sign_generic,EpTitle,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(527,722)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 225)}The Almerian Rebellion
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:39.77,italics,Byron,0,0,0,,So that's what the urgent report was?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:44.10,italics,Byron,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for him,\Nthe prince already knew of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:46.98,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Understood. Thank you for informing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:49.02,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Treat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:49.94,Default,Evelyn,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:06:00.54,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,And give him a reward of five \Nhundred... no, a thousand rean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.95,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Your Highness, what was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:08.38,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:13.48,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,The information he brought isn't \Neven useful to you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:16.43,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.87,0:06:20.35,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,a mere decurion came here to \Ninform me, despite the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:24.15,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I have to reward his loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:27.78,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,That's why you promised \Nhim so much money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:31.94,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I believe he's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:44.64,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,M... Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:48.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:55.34,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:57.35,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You look pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:03.64,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Hey. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:05.56,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Th-This...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:09.23,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Money?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:12.03,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It looks to be around five hundred rean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:15.28,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,S-Someone I didn't know gave it to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:19.26,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,a-as a reward for getting you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:22.49,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,to drink... this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:26.41,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I was told... it's a sleeping drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:29.24,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You were to mix it into my drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:32.03,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,then hand me over to them \Nonce I fell asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:35.47,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:38.06,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,It's the rebels again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:40.34,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Looks like they really want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:45.74,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I understand, but why did \Nyou bring this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:46.77,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:50.42,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I could never betray you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:53.62,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,You helped my mother, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:55.76,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,and my village...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:04.49,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,But they said I'd be killed if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:08.85,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,But still... I just \Ncouldn't betray you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.85,0:08:11.63,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,So... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:13.89,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.07,0:08:27.53,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.53,0:08:28.47,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,A reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:32.91,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,They tried to buy your \Nbetrayal for five hundred rean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:37.45,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,But you didn't do it,\Nso I'll add a zero to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:39.77,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,F-Five thousand...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:43.20,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,But... I can't accept this much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:46.04,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:51.74,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:55.22,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,You are truly a generous master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:57.94,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,More importantly, there's \Nsomething I want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:09:01.44,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Of course! I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.17,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'm going to drink this drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.67,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,When I fall asleep, take me to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:09.74,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:15.74,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Then, I want you to run \Nand hide immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:19.27,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,They'll try to silence \Nyou if you stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:21.00,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,M-Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:23.42,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:32.89,Default,Bandit1,0,0,0,,What a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:36.53,Default,Bandit1,0,0,0,,One stab with that creepy little \Ndagger, and it'd be all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:39.54,Default,Bandit2,0,0,0,,That's supposed to be a \Nlast resort, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:42.80,Default,Bandit2,0,0,0,,We can't go wrong if we \Ndo what Karfun says.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:46.09,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,They're my captors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.09,0:09:47.50,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,What's my situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.26,0:09:52.94,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Bound at the hands and feet, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.27,0:10:01.69,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I was right to hide my weapon. \NThey would've taken it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:04.76,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,And they didn't take my ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:17.74,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,My eyes have adjusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:21.25,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I thought I was in a room, but \Nthis is the back of a wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:31.07,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Show me your memories, Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:40.39,flashback,Bandit2,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.39,0:10:41.82,flashback,Bandit3,0,0,0,,Tie him up good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:44.27,flashback,Bandit1,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd the maid go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:47.79,flashback,Bandit2,0,0,0,,Leave her. We gotta get him out \Nbefore the guards catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:03.26,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.92,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I understand the situation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:19.53,Default,Bandit2,0,0,0,,Hey, which one of you\Ncan't tie a knot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:22.48,Default,Bandit1,0,0,0,,What, you lookin' fer a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:25.56,Default,Bandit1,0,0,0,,Your big brother saved you last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:27.37,Default,Bandit1,0,0,0,,but what's one li'l kid gonna—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:38.73,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:43.65,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I was hoping I'd get some useful \Ninformation, but you're just lackeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.05,0:11:45.94,Default,Bandit3,0,0,0,,Y-You stupid little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:47.14,Default,Bandit2,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:11.34,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:14.47,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What in the world is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:16.72,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I-I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:20.99,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I know you told me to hide, \Nbut I was worried about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.52,0:12:22.84,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,so... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.92,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You came to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.92,0:12:26.42,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:29.82,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,But... you did this by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:31.27,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:34.54,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Who's the captain here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:39.72,Default,Captain2,0,0,0,,I am. It's an honor to meet \Nyou, Thirteenth Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:41.68,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:45.93,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,They're with the ones who \Nattacked me a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:47.47,Default,Captain2,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:12:58.96,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Don't touch that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:09.84,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:11.56,Default,Captain1,0,0,0,,O-Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.06,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.51,0:13:18.06,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Is this the dagger they \Nwere talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:20.66,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,So much malice...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:23.43,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Through Leviathan,\NI can sense a curse on it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:26.19,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Sorcery...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.65,0:13:29.39,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,It's filled with the hatred \Nof the one who cursed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:32.91,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,Could this be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:41.64,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Can you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:46.59,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It should be easy for a\Nwater magic sword like you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:55.36,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Then show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:34.96,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Ah, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:42.44,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Excellent, Noah. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:48.60,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Last night, the leader of the rebels \Nwas pierced through the brow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:51.68,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,by a pillar of water that \Nappeared out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.78,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It was your doing, was it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:56.36,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You had your magic sword do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:58.29,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.34,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,As always, word travels fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.27,0:15:04.20,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I used the hatred in the \Ndagger to guide Leviathan
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:08.08,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,to the rebel leader with \Na long-distance sniping shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:16.76,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,It seems like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:23.05,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,After that, the Almerian rebels, \Nhaving lost their leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:29.37,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,were quickly suppressed \Nby Fourth Prince Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:37.47,Default,Runner,0,0,0,,Nearly all those involved in plotting \Nthe uprising have been arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:42.70,Default,Runner,0,0,0,,Your Majesty's judgment is requested \Nin deciding their punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.58,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Ready the horses and cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Every last one of them will be\Ndrawn and quartered!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:15:58.89,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,Brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.89,0:16:01.35,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,Excellent judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:03.36,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Just wait, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:08.49,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,They will pay at once for the crime of \Nlaunching a rebellion in your fief!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:12.10,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If I may, Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:15.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You mustn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:16.60,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:25.75,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this, Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:29.09,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,They must be punished in \Naccordance with the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:33.26,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,According to imperial law, rebel leaders \Nare to be cut in half at the waist,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:37.19,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,third-degree supporters and \Naccomplices are to be hanged,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.19,0:16:41.04,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and any others are to be \Nbeheaded for participating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.99,0:16:44.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Even if "drawn and quartered" \Nis simply idiomatic,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:47.48,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,no such punishment exists \Nin the laws of this empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.85,0:16:52.01,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,But these people sullied your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:55.69,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If the emperor takes the \Ninitiative in breaking the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.69,0:16:58.15,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,it can throw his supremacy into disarray.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:15.96,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Hmph. Your logic is sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:20.67,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You've done well to \Ncatch me in my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.39,0:17:31.56,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,But a tame punishment \Nwill not satisfy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.56,0:17:34.71,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Punish them to the fullest \Nextent of the law!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:36.78,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,There will be no commutations!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:39.02,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Will that suffice?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.05,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I see no problems whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.43,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,First Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:46.44,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,Sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:50.08,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I assume you heard all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:52.21,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(276,433)\an3\pos(212,242.666)}Noizhill\N{\fs13}First Prime Minister
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:51.96,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'll let you handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.54,0:17:54.22,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:58.07,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,Th-That's the Thirteenth Prince for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.07,0:18:00.10,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,How brave of him to admonish \Nthe emperor like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:02.47,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,And without the slightest \Nchange in his expression!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.47,0:18:05.06,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,His genius is truly a \Ngift from the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:06.84,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,A child prodigy indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:07.98,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,Remarkable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:10.27,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,His conviction is strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:16.43,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You stopped me from sullying this \Nempire's good name in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:18.48,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I must reward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:25.03,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Yes. I shall grant you a title.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:30.76,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Any of my children may be capable \Nof simply admonishing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:34.32,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,but to do so rightly \Nis a valuable talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:37.83,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,To make your cleverness \Nknown to all my subjects...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.87,0:18:41.17,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I grant you the title "Wise"!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.18,0:18:46.60,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,500)\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}MP: F\h\h\h\h\hWater: E+S\NStrength: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWind: F\NStamina: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F\NIntelligence: F+F\h\h\h\hLight: F \NSpirit: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hDark: F \NSpeed: F \NDexterity: F+F
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:46.60,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,500)\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H392D22&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 158 0 158 47 0 47
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:46.63,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,The prince has a new title!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:49.14,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord1\fade(500,179)\an7\fnTimes New Roman\c&HF8F9F6&\3c&HC2AF8C&\4c&HA98367&\shad3}Thirteenth Imperial Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:49.15,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,This has never happened before!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:51.65,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord1\fade(321,0)\an7\fnTimes New Roman\c&HF8F9F6&\3c&HC2AF8C&\4c&HA98367&\shad3}Wise Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:53.73,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.73,0:18:59.83,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Noah, if only you had been \Nborn a bit earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:07.79,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,Long live the Wise Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:09.46,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,Long live Wise Prince Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:13.67,Default,Spectators,0,0,0,,Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:16.95,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,By the way, Noah, the knight \Nselection exam is soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.95,0:19:18.80,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Have you decided how you will judge it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.23,0:19:23.21,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I have a plan. May I show you after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.21,0:19:24.22,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:45.22,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:08.78,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I will have the participants \Nattack me in this way
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:12.30,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and judge them based on how \Nclose their attacks get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.99,0:20:15.34,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Brilliant, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:21.16,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,This reduces the burden on you and\Neases the judgment process.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:24.28,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,But it is not without its risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:30.83,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,If any contender is powerful enough \Nto break through your defenses...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:33.54,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I am prepared to deal with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:40.50,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:44.50,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,That is what makes you my son,\Nan imperial prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:47.78,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,no, the Wise Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.36,0:20:50.22,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.03,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.03,0:21:15.29,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,do you not think saying,\N"if only you had been born earlier"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:17.26,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,before the public was a bit much?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.47,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,And what is the issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:23.55,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Not only did he admonish me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:26.56,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,but he took out an enemy leader without \Neven going to the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:28.16,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's unprecedented!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:29.48,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:36.68,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,that magic sword of his really does \Nseem to possess terrifying power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:37.63,Default,Noizhill,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:40.44,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:42.84,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,Sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.81,0:21:45.48,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Bring it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:46.73,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.76,0:21:54.31,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The legends say that the true seal \Non Leviathan must not be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:22:01.00,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,But perhaps, if Noah were to do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.45,0:22:12.97,sign_generic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an3\fade(443,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HC3D0DD&\3c&H374B69&\blur1\bord1.5\fs10\pos(302.667,258.667)}Translation:\NTiming:\NEditing:\NQuality Control:
